From 96608024535f70496b539edb13555ced9ec052a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 17:30:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] AIM D-133 doplnok (#170): PDF podklady v 3D zapnut / vypnut
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Nova sprava mosta SET_UNDERLAYS_3D { show } a stav viewera "podklady v 3D"
(aim/aimUnderlays3d.ts). Vypnute = ulozene podklady sa v 3D platne nekreslia,
kalibracia (_georef), ghost nahlad pocas kalibracie a zamknuty pôdorysny pohlad
(2D) ostavaju. Je to iny stav nez placement.visible (oko pri vykrese), ktory sa
uklada do DB a skryva aj 2D. view_state a APPLIED nesu underlays_3d. Prepinac
"Show in 3D" je pod panelom Underlays.

Upstream len v AIM-FORK blokoch: useDrawingUnderlay.ts (kopia placementu s
visible: false) a renderPanelBody.tsx (lenivy prepinac pod panelom).

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
